{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act52side", "eventName": "昨日海", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "YW-3", "avgTag": "行动后", "storyName": "破手铐", "storyInfo": "纳乔得知阿奎拉死在狱中的消息，决定加入互助会。艾丽妮奉卡门的命令，护送地牢中的海嗣到达船厂。", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g14_ibchurch_2", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$drift_intro", "key": "$drift_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——！", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 12, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我一度担心你醒不过来了，纳乔。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "手臂和假肢的接口处缺乏医疗维护，早就发炎了，你现在还在发烧，先休息一下。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}, {"id": 18, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这里是教堂？您就是阿奎拉的导师……？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1"}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "叫我奥卢斯吧。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#1$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯先生，阿奎拉被审判庭逮捕了。我不知道发生了什么，但几天前她托付我，如果她出事就来找你。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "原来她那个时候已经下定了决心。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您在说什么？什么决心？您能帮帮阿奎拉吗，她的脾气太硬，要是审讯的时候惹怒了审判官，就更麻烦了……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔……", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorknockquite"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "稍等。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$doorclosequite"}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "逮捕……地牢……阿奎拉……", "name": "模糊的声音"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "确认了吗……接下来该怎么办……", "name": "模糊的声音"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我明白了……", "name": "模糊的声音"}}, {"id": 43, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1"}, {"id": 45, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$dooropenquite"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 51, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉……阿奎拉怎么了？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#8$1"}, {"id": 53, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "请不要露出这副表情，医生告诉我我的手保不住的时候是这副表情，奶奶得知自己病重时也是这副表情……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 57, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我知道她为什么很多事都瞒着我，但您能不能——", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1"}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "纳乔。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉死了。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什么……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 67, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g2_courtprison", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 68, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 2.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你比我想象的更有耐心，在你们的计划里，你是领导岛民的角色。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呵，分析这些会让你更有安全感吗？", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#3$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 80, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "分析这些会让我确信，你很想离开这里，带领他们去做你认为正确的事。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 81, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 82, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“正确”……那听上去我们跟审判庭也没什么区别。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "为了你们口中的伊比利亚，你们将深海教会的成员和岛民混为一谈，因为这样能让你们最方便地做最正确的事。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你无法否认，许多岛民都与深海教会有染。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我确实认识不少加入深海教会的岛民，但你知道他们为什么这么做吗？", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我有个堕入深海教会的岛民朋友，他临刑前曾向我忏悔，他知道自己做错了事，也不会为此辩解。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但他说，至少和教徒们在一起的时候，他不用睡觉时还要提防有人砸碎他的窗户，至少会有人称他为同胞。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判庭不会蓄意伤害岛民。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但你们也不会惩罚做那种事的人。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你我都清楚，伊比利亚的“和平”是靠什么维系的，伊比利亚人无聊贫乏的生活又是靠什么“调剂”的。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我认识很多被人扔燃烧瓶的孩子，其中一个失去了一整条右手臂。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我从小就认识他，他善良到连条鳞都不敢杀，能背出经卷上的任何一段文字，时刻想向别人证明岛民也是普通的、善良的伊比利亚人。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#5$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但哪怕他如此问心无愧，他依旧提心吊胆。这就是伊比利亚。只要提到有人犯罪，连岛民自己都会相信是岛民干的。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "正是因此，审判庭尽可能保存了自建立以来的所有卷宗和档案。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们如实记载每一句话，就是因为我们知道自己在做多么危险的工作，而每次讯问的时候我们的美德都在受到考验。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "美德……好，就算我相信每一句被记录下的陈词都是真的，那你又如何保证每桩涉及岛民的调查都揭露了真相呢？", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真相？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你不能，我也不能。我们永远不会再知道，一个被邻居举报蓄意伤害、被扣押进地牢的岛民，是否曾经遭受过同一个邻居的欺凌。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们也永远不会知道，仇恨真正的起因是什么，公正的天平到底会向谁倾倒。在无尽的仇恨的循环里，我们永远无法原谅彼此。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "审判庭拥有选择，你们可以选择打捞港都，建立一座看上去对岛民宽松一些的城市，但我也有选择，我选择……", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_bat_imprisonment_intro", "key": "$m_bat_imprisonment_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "恨下去。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#8$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 2.0}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_black", "screenadapt": "coverall", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "ui_cutin_mask_vertical", "style": 1.0, "size": "1280, 250", "offset": "0,-100", "channel": 2.0}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 2.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "offset": "0,-50", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "aduration": 1.0, "sfrom": "1.3,1.3", "sto": "1.3,1.3"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 2.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "0,-100", "pto": "20,-100", "duration": 3.0}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 3.0}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉看向自己的手，那副做工粗糙的手铐边缘锋利，不知不觉中已经划伤了她的手腕。它仿佛在嘲弄受刑者，它根本不在乎她的死活。"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 2.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "aduration": 1.0, "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#1$1", "pfrom": "20,-100", "pto": "20,-100"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.1}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 2.0, "clear": "true"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.3}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "ui_cutin_mask_vertical", "style": 1.0, "size": "1280, 250", "offset": "0,50", "channel": 2.0}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 2.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "offset": "0,-50", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#6$1", "aduration": 1.0, "sfrom": "1.3,1.3", "sto": "1.3,1.3"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 2.0, "type": 3.0, "slot": "m", "pfrom": "0,-140", "pto": "25,-140", "duration": 5.0}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "阿奎拉知道自己的任务已经完成了，她只需要向审判庭隐瞒。接下来她能做的最好的事，是叫醒更多的岛民，更多不愿说出冤屈的人。"}}, {"id": 135, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，她在心底对她的朋友们说。她知道仇恨不是一个好选择，但这是能让他们团结起来做些什么的，唯一的选择。"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 137, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g2_courtprison", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 2.0, "clear": "true"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚人应当记住，岛民曾经做过什么，又遭受过什么。哪怕不是我，也有岛民会站出来，夺回他们自己应得的东西。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#10$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你的分析大部分都对，但有一点不准确。我其实并不想离开这里，大审判官阁下。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#3$1"}, {"id": 146, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什么？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2271_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我在这里迎来终结，或许对于我那些举棋不定的同胞而言更有价值。", "name": "阿奎拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2271_1#2$1"}, {"id": 150, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "等等——！", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 152, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {"image": "cg_blood", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_broadswordblood"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5, "xstrength": 15.0, "ystrength": 15.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "！", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 163, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 2.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 165, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g14_ibchurch_2", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$dignified_intro", "key": "$dignified_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她……自杀？！", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你看上去很悲伤，也很愤怒？", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 179, "prop": "CameraShake", "attributes": {"duration": 0.3, "xstrength": 30.0, "ystrength": 30.0, "vibrato": 30.0, "randomness": 90.0, "fadeout": "true", "block": "false"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……阿奎拉死了，奥卢斯先生！", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#11$1"}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当然……你当然有理由悲伤。但为什么愤怒？", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她总揶揄我为伊比利亚人工作得太卖力。可我们刚来这儿的时候，她工作起来比我还卖力得多。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#11$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我以为她才是对未来还有期望的那个人。我不明白，是什么东西让她抛下了所有这些。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#11$1"}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想，是因为她没有办法忽视同胞的境遇，纳乔。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 189, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以都是因为这个互助会，对吗？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 191, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我曾在伊比利亚各地游历，我知道生活在一个充斥着纷争和偏见的地方非常痛苦，我希望为我的同胞们做些什么。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 193, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我见过因堤坝崩溃消失在浪潮中的村落，也见过饿殍堆积的坟场；我救下过一些被当猎物追杀的阿戈尔人，也劝过流浪在外的岛民返乡。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 194, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然后我得出了一个结论。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 195, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如今在伊比利亚作祟的，并非突如其来的贫瘠，也非谣传之中的海中怪物，更不是被视为不祥之兆的岛民。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 196, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "悲剧的发生只是因为伊比利亚是一个建立在纷争之上的国家，因为它从未真正地渴望和平。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不明白您为什么在说这些，奥卢斯先生。您难道觉得阿奎拉是因为不想要和平，才做那些事？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，我只是想说，人们总在用立场来约束自己，规训自己。我们是岛民，他们是伊比利亚人，海里的是真正的阿戈尔人。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只有找准立场之后，人才会为之思考，才会为之努力，才会做出选择。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#2$1"}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……所以阿奎拉才总是跟我说，互助会里的才是“真正的同胞”？", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可能这也是为什么，我总觉得自己适应不了互助会的氛围。就算大家再怎么强调谁是“真正的同胞”，谁是叛徒、恶人……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也不会变得更安心，事情也不会变得更好。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但人们诉说的遭遇是真实的。或许曾经阿奎拉想要通过打捞工作重整自己的生活，但只是听到同胞们的那些遭遇……", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就足够让她萌生出为同胞们做些什么的想法了。所以她做了选择，她死在了狱中，为了保守一个秘密。", "name": "奥卢斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_941_1#5$1"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "秘密……", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奥卢斯先生，让我加入互助会吧。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想知道阿奎拉到底是为了什么而死。", "name": "纳乔"}, "figure_art": "avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 216, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 218, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 220, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 222, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$comedy_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 225, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（细腻的咀嚼声）", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 229, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（优雅的啜饮声）", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……吃饭也要顾及贵族礼仪吗，特菲？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 233, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嘘，有些船工才刚刚开始相信我的贵族名头，不能前功尽弃。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 235, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这份工作来之不易，特菲。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#3$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我会努力的，刚刚连工头都说我在学习船只设计图上有天分，看来我确实是伊比利亚王室海军的后裔。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，招揽拥护者就没那么顺利了……那个萨尔瓦多真是油盐不进！", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我决定换个说法，让他相信我是身为贵族末裔又加入审判庭最终光荣殉道的传奇圣徒的遗孤，你看如何？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#5$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 245, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 247, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "行啦，我知道你不乐意听这些，说说你自己吧，瓦列里奥。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#6$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 249, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我？", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 251, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "对啊，我们刚搭伙的时候是你说的想来港都。现在在船厂老是找不到你人，是不是去寻亲了？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#13$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "过了那么多年，哪还找得到亲人呢？我受伤之后他们就跟我断绝关系了。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "太过分了，就算烧伤在这里很难治，也不能就这么丢下你啊。而且我记得你的伤是为了救一个朋友才受的吧，他也不管你？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 256, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#11$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "都过去了。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不能就这么过去！你自己或许忘了，我可记得我第一次见到你的样子。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "keep": "true", "initamount": 0.0, "amount": 0.7, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "bg_ibbar", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天有一艘船出航♪", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}, {"id": 269, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "羽兽在船舷上踱步——♪", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#5$1"}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老板，结账。", "name": "疲惫的酒客"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咳咳……吹响号角……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "别唱了，小姑娘。人早就走光了。", "name": "酒馆老板"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#13$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "两个铜币，也就一顿饭钱。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那边还有他们喝剩的半杯酒，想喝就喝吧，你这嗓子都唱哑了。", "name": "酒馆老板"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "可以吗？谢谢，德·托莱多家族会记得你的恩典的！", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "欸，那边还有一个人啊？", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#15$1"}, {"id": 284, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你从他身上赚不到住宿钱。那家伙一身烧伤，半死不活的，进来不说话也不买东西，就倚在墙角。", "name": "酒馆老板"}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "听说他一直在往海边走，像个朝圣者。咱也不知道海边有什么圣可朝，那边分明只有罪孽。最好离他远点。", "name": "酒馆老板"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#12$1"}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "再离他远点，他可就连饭都要不到了……", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#12$1"}, {"id": 292, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "算了，我饿一顿也不打紧。老板，两个铜币，给他上点吃的。", "name": "特菲"}, "figure_art": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}, {"id": 294, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "CameraEffect", "attributes": {"effect": "Grayscale", "fadetime": 0.0, "amount": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g8_shipatelier", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "老板给的不多，一块面包，一片比纸都薄的火腿。你吃了整整一个下午，每啃两口就要听我讲半个小时。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊比利亚人很多，伊比利亚人也都差不多。但为了忽悠人和听人忽悠，一顿饭能吃一个下午的，可就咱俩。", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 305, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊。", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 307, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 309, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_armour", "loop": "true", "channel": "bgs"}}, {"id": 311, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "bgs", "fadetime": 3.0}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 313, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_npc_2276_1#1$1", "duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 314, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 315, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "-200,0", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"duration": 0.5}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 319, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "right", "name": "avg_393_toledo_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么多惩戒军，发生什么了？", "name": "特菲"}}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "left", "name": "avg_npc_2266_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "瓦列里奥"}}, {"id": 324, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 325, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 327, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "74_g4_seasidest_n", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 329, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 330, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 331, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$mist_intro", "key": "$mist_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 332, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 334, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 336, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "斐戴拉大审判官。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#7$1"}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 339, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您……看上去很疲惫，甚至您的衣角还有血迹……伤势又严重了吗？", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#10$1"}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "它只是没有变好。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 343, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要不要再找医生评估一下您的身体状况，或许您需要用药而非静养。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#10$1"}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "放心，它总会好起来的。而且，能让我消除疲惫的东西，你已经带来了不是吗？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这个铁匣子里面的，就是圣徒阁下想让船厂接手的东西——", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那把能解除港都所有系统的权限封锁、维系港都所有城市功能正常运作的“钥匙”？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是的。其实……其实圣徒阁下还说——", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#8$1"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好，好……等中心城区重新升上海面，雷亚-伊比利亚重新出现在伊比利亚的版图之上，过去的伤痛都会烟消云散的。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 353, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们是不是也该重新学起过去被封禁的歌谣，或者跳支舞了呢……嗯？你刚刚想说什么？", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_4009_irene_1#13$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，没什么。", "name": "艾丽妮"}, "figure_art": "avg_4009_irene_1#13$1"}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "让圣徒阁下安心吧，我会保护船厂和铁匣中的希望。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以我对审判庭和伊比利亚的信念起誓。", "name": "斐戴拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2270_1#1$1"}, {"id": 359, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "bgeffect", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "hidecgitem", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}